[
  "Shot with a Canon EOS R5, 85mm f/1.8 lens. The scene features two plates, each holding a slice of golden-brown toasted whole-wheat bread topped with a rustic, hearty portion of smoky navy beans and eggs. One plate is sharp in the foreground, showing the detailed texture of the beans and a perfectly poached egg, while the second plate is slightly blurred in the background. The dish is captured from a 3/4 overhead angle, ensuring every component is visible: the beans are coated in a rich, deep-red sauce made from tomato paste and smoked paprika, studded with bright green wilted baby spinach leaves. Two large eggs are nestled into the bean mixture on each plate, with opaque, firm white edges and vibrant, soft, runny golden yolks. The toast is visible beneath the beans, its crisp texture evident at the edges. Soft natural side light from a window on the left creates subtle highlights on the moist bean sauce and a gentle sheen on the yolks. The plates are set on a weathered, dark-stained oak table with visible wood grain. Props include a simple, slightly tarnished stainless steel fork resting casually on a rumpled, off-white linen napkin beside the front plate, and a few stray specks of smoked paprika and a single wilted spinach leaf scattered naturally on the wood. The scene is cozy and lived-in, with a small, stray sauce drip on the rim of the plate. Photorealistic, not AI-generated looking. Warm, golden-hour color temperature. No plastic sheen, no perfect symmetry, no hands, no text, no watermark."
]
